# Code owners for PEAT
#
# Owners listed here are automatically requested as reviewers on any
# Pull Request that modifies files matching their pattern, and are the
# people to ask about that area of the codebase.
#
# Rules:
# - Use GitHub usernames (@username) or teams (@org/team-name) only,
#   NOT full names or email addresses.
# - The LAST matching pattern takes precedence, so keep the catch-all
#   default at the top and more specific paths below it.
# - This file complements AUTHORS, which lists everyone who has
#   contributed to PEAT. Being in AUTHORS does not make someone a code owner.
#
# Syntax reference:
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

